   "text": "NORTHLINE METRO RAIL CORPORATION\nMinutes of the 87th meeting of the Board of Directors, held on 30 July 2026 at the Corporate Office.\nItem 1 — Phase II extension\nThe Board noted that civil works on the Phase II viaduct are 62% complete against a planned 70%, and resolved that the Director (Projects) shall submit a recovery schedule to the Board by 30 September 2026.\nItem 2 — Budget\nThe revised budget of 412 crore for rolling stock procurement was approved, subject to the tender being re-issued with the amended technical specification.\nThe next meeting of the Board will be convened in October at a date to be notified by the Company Secretary.",
